  "name": "Cursed!: Reflection returns its share of the damage the player deals, never periodic damage",
  "contract": [
    "Issue #10788. Major, Medium and Minor Reflection (901852/901853/901854) deal 75%, 50% and 25% of",
    "the direct damage the player deals to another unit back to the player as 901856. The target still",
    "takes the full damage, the reflected hit does not reflect again (the share stays exact), a",
    "direct spell hit (Heroic Strike 78) is reflected, and Rend 772's periodic damage is not. Ratings",
    "and zero avoidance make every swing land; level 79 keeps the trial below its completing level."
  ],
